Z||000004||DXR_DAD||06-16-2000||05:19 PM||||ANY TRAILER BACK-UP LIGHTS WILL BE EASY<BR>TO INSTALL, THEY ARE MADE TO HOOK RIGHT UP TO YOUR BACK-UPS. NO FRAMES, THE SCREWS GO THROUGH THE LENS. JUST LOOK AT SOME CARS TURN SIGNAL THIS IS THE TYPE OF LIGHT YOU WANT. THEY ARE MADE THE SAME AS THE FRONT TURN SIGNALS ON THE FIERO! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>DXR_DAD<P>sorry for the caps.<BR>||||reg||14
