Z||000026||Monkeyman||06-28-2000||11:07 PM||||$25 sounds a little more reasonable.  I'll have to start looking for them soon.  I'm not sure exactly what I'll do with my tail lights.  I have a custom pearlized purple paint on the Grape Ape and the tail lights are misted with the same color.  I like Paul Vargas' "PONTIAC" tail light treatment and my own "FIERO" tail light treatment so I might do a combination of those.  (I'll have to look into how Pauls tail light thing is wired up, though.  I don't know if I can cut the back up light wires and still use his mod.)  I'm sure that, when I get your back up light mod done and when I get the car repainted, I'll have the paint shop mist the new backup lights just like my tail lights.||||reg||1
